From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jordan Bettcher <thebettcher@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 23:34:20 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] [swiftshader] Add the MC XCOFF base classes to the bundled
 LLVM PPC target

swiftshader_llvm_ppc compiles PPCXCOFFObjectWriter.cpp and
PPCMCAsmInfo.cpp, which subclass MCXCOFFObjectTargetWriter and
MCAsmInfoXCOFF, but the .cpp files defining those base classes are not
in any source set (MCXCOFFObjectTargetWriter.cpp only under
is_ubsan_vptr). libvk_swiftshader.so then fails to link on ppc64le:

  ld.lld: error: undefined symbol: llvm::MCAsmInfoXCOFF::MCAsmInfoXCOFF()
  ld.lld: error: undefined symbol:
    llvm::MCXCOFFObjectTargetWriter::MCXCOFFObjectTargetWriter(bool)

Add both sources to swiftshader_llvm_ppc. Linux ppc64le is ELF, so the
XCOFF code is dead, but its vtables must resolve. Same change as the
omarchy chromium recipe's swiftshader-ppc-xcoff-baseclasses.patch, which
fixes the identical source set in Chromium's SwiftShader.

SwiftShader is the Vulkan ICD the engine's unit tests run on in CI; it
is not part of libflutter_linux_gtk.so.

Class: upstreamable fix (to SwiftShader).
---
 third_party/llvm-10.0/BUILD.gn | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/engine/src/flutter/third_party/swiftshader/third_party/llvm-10.0/BUILD.gn b/engine/src/flutter/third_party/swiftshader/third_party/llvm-10.0/BUILD.gn
index f99abba..1ba08db 100644
--- a/engine/src/flutter/third_party/swiftshader/third_party/llvm-10.0/BUILD.gn
+++ b/engine/src/flutter/third_party/swiftshader/third_party/llvm-10.0/BUILD.gn
@@ -1214,6 +1214,8 @@ swiftshader_llvm_source_set("swiftshader_llvm_mips") {
 
 swiftshader_llvm_source_set("swiftshader_llvm_ppc") {
   sources = [
+    "llvm/lib/MC/MCAsmInfoXCOFF.cpp",
+    "llvm/lib/MC/MCXCOFFObjectTargetWriter.cpp",
     "llvm/lib/Target/PowerPC/AsmParser/PPCAsmParser.cpp",
     "llvm/lib/Target/PowerPC/Disassembler/PPCDisassembler.cpp",
     "llvm/lib/Target/PowerPC/MCTargetDesc/PPCAsmBackend.cpp",
